OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain across
OL,6,FScotland and Northern Ireland will
OL,7,Fspread slowly south, perhaps reaching
OL,8,Fnorthern England later. Elsewhere,
OL,9,Fmostly dry with variable cloud and
OL,10,Fisolated southwest showers. A warm
OL,11,Fnight for many.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FRain in the north will drift
OL,14,Fsoutheastwards with some heavy spells.
OL,15,FElsewhere, sunny or clear spells and
OL,16,Fmostly dry, though isolated showers
OL,17,Fpossible in the southeast. Feeling hot
OL,18,Fonce again.
